              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How to use it",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "14px",
                      "color": "#182027"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1. Select a tab, or a live answer on the left, to open a page.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "11px",
                      "color": "#182027"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. The Region, Segment, Category and Sales rep filters follow you to every page.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "11px",
                      "color": "#182027"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3. Right-click any customer, then Drill through > Customer detail, to see everything about that customer.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "11px",
                      "color": "#182027"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4. Hover a region on the Overview to see its reps.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "11px",
                      "color": "#182027"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "5. Change the measure of the monthly chart with the Metric filter.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "11px",
                      "color": "#182027"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The sentences in magenta are DAX measures: they rewrite themselves when you filter.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "11px",
                      "color": "#970D63"
                    }
                  }
